 "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
 "description": "Every Stage B-D row type is closed: unknown fields, missing fields and unregistered enum members are rejected.  behavioral_row and feasibility_gate_row reproduce the frozen protocol future-table field sets exactly.  No field in this contract carries an activation, hidden state, probe, lens, patching, ablation or generated-token value, and no field admits a behavioral-confirmation, mechanistic, RQ2/S4 or scientific-evidence object.",
 "title": "Study 2 Stage B-D closed behavioral and Gate A contract"
}
